  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Smoke & Mirrors** (2 other sources): Only Ambrose's verses performed, featuring Grim Reaper raps and Dizzee Rascal quotes; Performed only Ambrose's verses, including Grim Reaper raps and Dizzee Rascal quotes [1][2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Frankenstein**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Superposition**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Blue Morpho**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Butterfly 3000**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Cyboogie**: back after 163 archived shows (2080 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Smoke & Mirrors**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-11-01** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 129 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-11-01.SBD**: soundboard; 0 songs; 129 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Amby requested a drum solo, prompting a lengthy heavy drum improvisation [1]\n- Amby asked audience for a drum solo, leading to extended drum improvisation [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-11-01**: taped by Tora Tapes; transferred by Tora Tapes; source: FOB > Zoom F3 + Røde M5 > WAV > Audacity > WAV [1]\n- **kglw2025-11-01.SBD**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joseph Santarpia, Gaspard De Mulemeester, Grace Reader and Brandon DeLapp; source: SBD [2]",
